erse takes an  extremely high emotional toll on him  and yeah that's pretty much everything  to know about quantum superman right  he's extremely powerful  but rarely used in dc comics really only  showing up when grant morrison's writing  stories about the multiverse so if we're  going to have a series on the most  powerful characters  in comics the quantum superman of earth  4 definitely makes the list but let me  know what you guys think let me know  down in the comments section  if you guys are new here to comments  explain make sure you guys hit the sub  button to become part of the rob core if  you guys enjoy this video  make sure you drop a like and i will  catch you all later  [Music]  peace  [Applause]  [Music]  you

